{
  "source": "Prompts/when-you-need-more-8.mp4",
  "duration": 163.189875,
  "segments": [
    {
      "start": 0.0,
      "end": 5.14,
      "text": "For many tasks, you open your AI app, ask a question, and keep the conversation go out."
    },
    {
      "start": 5.78,
      "end": 7.78,
      "text": "But some tasks ask more of AI."
    },
    {
      "start": 8.34,
      "end": 13.3,
      "text": "You might need help working through a complicated plan, weighing options, or investigating information"
    },
    {
      "start": 13.3,
      "end": 18.72,
      "text": "across sources. Depending on the app and your subscription, you may have three other choices"
    },
    {
      "start": 18.72,
      "end": 24.58,
      "text": "for these demanding tasks. The model, thinking, and research. You won't need to change them every"
    },
    {
      "start": 24.58,
      "end": 29.9,
      "text": "time, but knowing what they do helps you get a significantly better answer. When you use an"
    },
    {
      "start": 29.9,
      "end": 37.14,
      "text": "AI app, an LLM powers its answers. Think of it as the engine inside the app. Choosing a model"
    },
    {
      "start": 37.14,
      "end": 42.72,
      "text": "means choosing your engine. Different models have different capabilities. You start with the default,"
    },
    {
      "start": 43.06,
      "end": 48.34,
      "text": "but can upgrade to a more capable one when needed. On the which model graphic, the everyday"
    },
    {
      "start": 48.34,
      "end": 54.06,
      "text": "model is for quick questions, like suggest a funny movie to watch tonight. The more capable model"
    },
    {
      "start": 54.06,
      "end": 59.66,
      "text": "handles demanding tasks. For example, help me plan a summer business, including costs, pricing,"
    },
    {
      "start": 60.1,
      "end": 65.0,
      "text": "and how many customers I'll need. By making that selection, you physically swap the underlying"
    },
    {
      "start": 65.0,
      "end": 71.34,
      "text": "engine for one built to handle heavy duty detailed planning. Choosing a model changes your LLM,"
    },
    {
      "start": 71.62,
      "end": 76.7,
      "text": "but thinking is a different variable. It doesn't change the engine. It changes how much time the"
    },
    {
      "start": 76.7,
      "end": 82.4,
      "text": "AI spends working through your task. It uses extra computational time to work through steps,"
    },
    {
      "start": 82.86,
      "end": 89.7,
      "text": "weigh options, and check its answer before responding. With less thinking, ask, turn these notes from"
    },
    {
      "start": 89.7,
      "end": 94.92,
      "text": "our group meeting into a clear checklist. With more thinking, ask, help us divide this project"
    },
    {
      "start": 94.92,
      "end": 100.04,
      "text": "among four people. We have one week, different schedules, and only two people know how to edit"
    },
    {
      "start": 100.04,
      "end": 106.88,
      "text": "video. Selecting more thinking grants the AI the necessary time allowance to untangle multivariable"
    },
    {
      "start": 106.88,
      "end": 113.62,
      "text": "logic puzzles. There is one more option, research. This mode gathers information from different"
    },
    {
      "start": 113.62,
      "end": 118.52,
      "text": "websites and brings it together so you can compare your options. Regular chat can look"
    },
    {
      "start": 118.52,
      "end": 123.38,
      "text": "things up on the internet too, but research is designed for a fuller comprehensive investigation"
    },
    {
      "start": 123.38,
      "end": 129.62,
      "text": "across several sources simultaneously. For a regular chat, I live in Dallas. How long would it take"
    },
    {
      "start": 129.62,
      "end": 136.0,
      "text": "me to drive to Texas A&M in college station versus UT Austin? For deep research, I want to study"
    },
    {
      "start": 136.0,
      "end": 140.66,
      "text": "physics and am considering Texas A&M and UT Austin. Compare their physics programs,"
    },
    {
      "start": 141.42,
      "end": 145.72,
      "text": "undergraduate research opportunities, admissions requirements, and costs. Show your sources."
    },
    {
      "start": 147.12,
      "end": 152.06,
      "text": "Deep research transforms the AI from a quick reference guide into a web investigator"
    },
    {
      "start": 152.06,
      "end": 159.06,
      "text": "capable of synthesizing vast amounts of data. Model, thinking, research. Use them when the work"
    },
    {
      "start": 159.06,
      "end": 159.62,
      "text": "demands more."
    }
  ],
